ind":"announcement","title":"🎉 Broken Shell Releases in Janurary 2027! 🎉","summary":"Hi everyone,We are excited to announce that Broken Shell is officially scheduled to release in Janurary 14, 2027!This is a special moment for our team, and we are incredibly grateful to celebrate it with all of you. Your support, encouragement, and feedback throughout development have helped make this project a reality.Broken Shell has been a journey of passion, creativity, and dedication. We've worked hard to create a unique experience, and we can't wait for you to explore the world we've built","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T13:26:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067926117","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3018500-1840944183789841","game_id":"steam-3018500","kind":"announcement","title":"Broken Shell Featured in Trailer Tuesday Show","summary":"We’re excited to share that our game has been selected for the Trailer Tuesday Show, a digital showcase celebrating creativity through trailers, updates, and fresh announcements from developers worldwide.This edition brings together a diverse lineup of studios, offering players a curated look at unique and upcoming titles while giving us a great opportunity to introduce our work to new audiences, connect with streamers and creators, and highlight the experience we’ve been crafting with care.Than","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-18T20:19:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183789841","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3018500-1835236783574172","game_id":"steam-3018500","kind":"announcement","title":"Official Publisher Announcement","summary":"Broken Shell Is Now Part of the Aroko Game Studio FamilyWe’re excited to share a milestone, Aroko Game Studio is now the official publisher of Broken Shell. This marks an important step forward for both the game and our studio as we expand our publishing efforts and welcome new titles into our growing family.From the moment we first experienced Broken Shell, we saw something special, a deeply atmospheric, emotionally driven journey built on love, connection, and powerful storytelling. It’s a wor","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-16T12:55:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783574172","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3018500-1791580426131618","game_id":"steam-3018500","kind":"announcement","title":"✨ We’re LIVE on Kickstarter! ✨","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45041021/a0da23d30a73b53bc45f3389cc404918f6233845.jpg 🚨 IT’S OFFICIAL! 🚨 ✨ We’re LIVE on Kickstarter! ✨ with a NEW Trailer! ➡️ https://t.ly/n8pUK 🚀 🐚 Embark on a heartwarming adventure 🧩 Solve meaningful puzzles ❤️ Protect what you love Your support means everything. Let’s make this dream a reality, together! 💙🙏 How to help: Support us at Kickstarter Wishlist Broken Shell on Steam Share with Your Friends on X Join our Discord Thank you for your support! Big Claw Friends!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-02-18T17:12:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1791580426131618","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3018500-5875595438684064191","game_id":"steam-3018500","kind":"announcement","title":"Broken Shell is coming to Kickstarter","summary":"We’re excited to announce that Broken Shell is coming to Kickstarter! Follow us and get ready to back this cozy, hand-drawn adventure. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45041021/83770ec9c2e8271ceb08f615f883cee0e80197c0.jpg {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45041021/d4295defd25db4ff18950058c5f06accaa52a280.jpg How to help: Follow our pre-launch page at Kickstarter Wishlist Broken Shelll on Steam Follow us on X Join our Discord Thank you for your support! Big Claw Friends!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-08-21T10:02:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5875595438684064191","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3018500-5875595438683991715","game_id":"steam-3018500","kind":"announcement","title":"Broken Shell at Wholesome Steam Celebration!","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45041021/3f0bc4423ed4367f7cae9dc0823b215aa0883626.jpg Claw Friends! We're excited to announce that Broken Shell is featured in the Wholesome Steam Celebration! Curated by Wholesome Games along with a collection of cozy and wholesome titles, Broken Shell is a about a cute couple searching for a new home in a very emotional tale. The demo for Broken Shell is available now, so please take a look during the festival, and be sure to wishlist the game below! https://store.steampower","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-08-21T09:34:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5875595438683991715","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3018500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:15:14Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:15:13Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3018500":"2026-10-26T10:15:14Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3018500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:15:13Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:1